async function uploadExplicationImages(sourceId,fileList,field='references'){const files=[...(fileList||[])].filter(f=>f&&String(f.type||'').startsWith('image/'));if(!files.length)return;const section=schema.sections.find(s=>s.id==='director-explication'),block=section?.blocks?.find(b=>b.id==='directorExplication');if(!section||!block)return;const root=appEl.querySelector('[data-director-explication="directorExplication"]')?.closest('.work-block'),note=root?.querySelector(`[data-block-save-note="directorExplication"]`);try{const current=collectSection(section.id)?.directorExplication||collectDirectorExplication(root,explicationData()),id=String(sourceId),item=current.items?.[id]||{},added=[];for(let i=0;i<files.length;i++){const original=files[i];if(note)note.textContent=`Готуємо зображення ${i+1}/${files.length}…`;const prepared=await prepareReferenceImage(original),file=prepared.file,safe=file.name.replace(/[^a-zA-Z0-9а-яА-ЯіїєґІЇЄҐ._-]+/g,'_'),path=`directing-lab/${key}/directorExplication/${field}/${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2,7)}-${safe}`,url=await uploadReferenceWithProgress(path,file,pct=>{if(note)note.textContent=`Завантаження ${i+1}/${files.length} · ${pct}%`});added.push({name:original.name,url,size:file.size,originalSize:original.size,type:file.type,compressed:prepared.compressed,uploadedAt:new Date().toISOString()})}current.items={...(current.items||{}),[id]:{...item,[field]:[...tableImages(item[field]),...added]}};const now=new Date().toISOString(),patch={updatedAt:now,studentUpdatedAt:now};for(const [targetId,targetVal] of Object.entries(linkedSaveEntries(block,current)))patch[`answers.${targetId}`]=targetVal;await safeUpdateDoc(workRef,patch);work.answers={...(work.answers||{})};for(const [targetId,targetVal] of Object.entries(linkedSaveEntries(block,current)))work.answers[targetId]=targetVal;dirtyBlocks.delete('directorExplication');if(note)note.textContent=`Додано ${added.length} зображенн${added.length===1?'я':'я'} ✓`;refreshLinkedViewsPreservingDrafts()}catch(e){console.error(e);if(note)note.textContent='Не вдалося завантажити зображення';alert(referenceUploadErrorMessage(e))}}
async function removeExplicationImage(sourceId,index,field='references'){const section=schema.sections.find(s=>s.id==='director-explication'),block=section?.blocks?.find(b=>b.id==='directorExplication');if(!section||!block)return;const root=appEl.querySelector('[data-director-explication="directorExplication"]')?.closest('.work-block'),current=collectSection(section.id)?.directorExplication||collectDirectorExplication(root,explicationData()),item=current.items?.[sourceId]||{},refs=tableImages(item[field]);refs.splice(index,1);current.items={...(current.items||{}),[sourceId]:{...item,[field]:refs}};const now=new Date().toISOString(),patch={updatedAt:now,studentUpdatedAt:now};for(const [targetId,targetVal] of Object.entries(linkedSaveEntries(block,current)))patch[`answers.${targetId}`]=targetVal;await safeUpdateDoc(workRef,patch);work.answers={...(work.answers||{})};for(const [targetId,targetVal] of Object.entries(linkedSaveEntries(block,current)))work.answers[targetId]=targetVal;dirtyBlocks.delete('directorExplication');refreshLinkedViewsPreservingDrafts()}
function tempoCurveMarkup(root){
 const rows=[...root.querySelectorAll('[data-linked-item]')],palette=['#2563eb','#7c3aed','#db2777','#ea580c','#059669','#0891b2','#ca8a04','#4f46e5'];
 if(!rows.length)return'<span class="muted">Додайте рядки, щоб побачити темпо-ритмічний профіль.</span>';
 const splitLabel=(s,max=18)=>{const words=String(s||'').trim().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);if(!words.length)return['Без назви'];const lines=[''];for(const w of words){const i=lines.length-1;if((lines[i]+' '+w).trim().length<=max||!lines[i])lines[i]=(lines[i]+' '+w).trim();else if(lines.length<3)lines.push(w);else{lines[2]=(lines[2]+' '+w).trim();}}if(lines[2]?.length>max+5)lines[2]=lines[2].slice(0,max+2)+'...';return lines.slice(0,3)};
 const all=rows.map((tr,i)=>{const raw=tr.querySelector('[data-tempo-intensity]')?.value.trim()||'',n=Number(raw),no=tr.querySelector('.linked-no>b')?.textContent?.trim()||String(i+1),title=tr.querySelector('[data-shared-title]')?.value?.trim()||'',type=tr.querySelector('[data-shared-type]')?.value?.trim()||'',groupKey=(no.split('.')[0]||String(i+1)).trim();return{no,title,type,v:raw!==''&&Number.isFinite(n)&&n>=1&&n<=5?n:null,rowIndex:i,groupKey}}),vals=all.filter(x=>x.v!==null);
 if(!vals.length)return'<span class="muted">Вкажіть інтенсивність 1-5 хоча б для однієї структурної одиниці.</span>';
 const W=Math.max(980,rows.length*155),H=340,padL=58,padR=32,padT=58,padB=108,plotW=W-padL-padR,plotH=H-padT-padB,x=i=>padL+(rows.length>1?i*plotW/(rows.length-1):plotW/2),y=v=>padT+(5-v)*plotH/4,baseline=H-padB;
 const groupMap=new Map();all.forEach((item,idx)=>{if(!groupMap.has(item.groupKey))groupMap.set(item.groupKey,{key:item.groupKey,start:idx,end:idx,title:item.title||item.type||`Блок ${item.groupKey}`});const g=groupMap.get(item.groupKey);g.end=idx;if(item.no===item.groupKey&&item.title)g.title=item.title});const groups=[...groupMap.values()].map((g,i)=>({...g,color:palette[i%palette.length]})),groupByKey=Object.fromEntries(groups.map(g=>[g.key,g]));
 const grid=[1,2,3,4,5].map(v=>`<line class="tempo-grid" x1="${padL}" y1="${y(v)}" x2="${W-padR}" y2="${y(v)}"></line><text class="tempo-y-label" x="${padL-12}" y="${y(v)+4}" text-anchor="end">${v}</text>`).join('');
 const ribbons=groups.filter(g=>g.end>g.start).map(g=>{const x1=g.start===0?padL:(x(g.start-1)+x(g.start))/2,x2=g.end===rows.length-1?W-padR:(x(g.end)+x(g.end+1))/2;return`<g><rect x="${x1}" y="22" width="${Math.max(2,x2-x1)}" height="7" rx="3.5" fill="${g.color}" opacity=".78"></rect><text class="tempo-band-label" x="${(x1+x2)/2}" y="43" text-anchor="middle" fill="${g.color}">${esc(g.title||'')}</text></g>`}).join('');
 const pts=vals.map(p=>({x:x(p.rowIndex),y:y(p.v),...p}));let path='';if(pts.length){path=`M ${pts[0].x} ${pts[0].y}`;for(let i=1;i<pts.length;i++){const a=pts[i-1],b=pts[i],mx=(a.x+b.x)/2;path+=` C ${mx} ${a.y}, ${mx} ${b.y}, ${b.x} ${b.y}`;}}
 const area=pts.length>1?`${path} L ${pts[pts.length-1].x} ${baseline} L ${pts[0].x} ${baseline} Z`:'';
 const stems=pts.map(p=>`<line x1="${p.x}" y1="${p.y}" x2="${p.x}" y2="${baseline}" stroke="#cbd5e1" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="3 5" opacity=".8"></line>`).join('');
 const dots=pts.map(p=>{const color=groupByKey[p.groupKey]?.color||'#2563eb',name=p.title||p.type||`Структурна одиниця ${p.no}`,lines=splitLabel(name),label=lines.map((line,j)=>`<tspan x="${p.x}" dy="${j?14:0}">${esc(line)}</tspan>`).join('');return`<g><title>${esc(`${name}. Інтенсивність ${p.v}`)}</title><circle cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="10" fill="#fff" stroke="${color}" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="${p.x}" cy="${p.y}" r="5" fill="${color}"></circle><text x="${p.x}" y="${p.y-15}" text-anchor="middle" fill="${color}" font-size="12" font-weight="800">${p.v}</text><text class="tempo-x-label" x="${p.x}" y="${baseline+26}" text-anchor="middle">${label}</text></g>`}).join('');
 return `<svg viewBox="0 0 ${W} ${H}" role="img" aria-label="Темпо-ритмічний профіль"><defs><linearGradient id="tempoProfileFill" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#6366f1" stop-opacity=".18"></stop><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#6366f1" stop-opacity=".02"></stop></linearGradient></defs><rect x="1" y="1" width="${W-2}" height="${H-2}" rx="18" fill="#fff" stroke="#dbe4f0"></rect>${ribbons}${grid}<line class="tempo-axis" x1="${padL}" y1="${baseline}" x2="${W-padR}" y2="${baseline}"></line><line class="tempo-axis" x1="${padL}" y1="${padT}" x2="${padL}" y2="${baseline}"></line>${stems}${area?`<path d="${area}" fill="url(#tempoProfileFill)"></path>`:''}${path?`<path d="${path}" fill="none" stroke="#4f46e5" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"></path>`:''}${dots}<text x="${padL}" y="18" fill="#0f172a" font-size="14" font-weight="800">Темпо-ритмічний профіль</text><text x="${W-padR}" y="18" text-anchor="end" fill="#64748b" font-size="11">1 - мінімальна інтенсивність, 5 - пікова</text></svg>`;
}
